- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md`, and `docs/AI_HANDOFF.md` before starting work.
- Follow the current-day scope in `docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md`.
- **Day 6 is planning only;** do not write API or feature code until trainer approval is recorded in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
- Before REST API integration on Day 7, review `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md`, `docs/DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, and `docs/API_CONTRACT.md`.
- Ensure all API-backed screens support 4 mandatory UI states: `Loading`, `Content/Success`, `Empty`, and `Error`.
- Preserve current Kotlin Android MVVM conventions and avoid unapproved UI framework migrations.
- Follow 4-step defect debugging (**Reproduce → Observe → Isolate → Verify**) and record findings in `docs/DEBUGGING_LOG.md`.
- Record actual build, test, and runtime results in `docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md`.
